<section class="panel food-panel waiting" id="food_panel" aria-labelledby="food_panel_label"><h2 class="panel-tag" id="food_panel_label">YOUR FOOD · 음식 종목</h2><div class="food-emoji" id="food_emoji" aria-hidden="true">🍴</div><div class="food-copy"><div class="food-group" id="food_group">마지막 뽑기</div><div class="food-name placeholder" id="food_name">무엇을 먹을까요?</div><div class="food-examples" id="food_examples">역을 정한 뒤 음식 종목을 뽑아요</div></div></section>
